      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Fe2O3 is found to be a cost-effective and environmentally friendly catalyst for chemical looping generation of NH3 - a future fuel. The optimal Fe2O3 loading on nitrogen carriers, AIN, is 5 wt%. Fe2O3 can reduce the activation energy of the N-desorption step of AIN by 100 kJ mol-1 or ∼30%."},
